  /// <summary>
  /// A standard message document.
  /// The purpose of APP-11 is to provide user’s with definitive reference of
  /// messages and supporting tables mandated for use in Joint, Land, Maritime and
  /// Air Operations.
  /// It is a compendium of formatted, structured and voice general purpose
  /// messages for command and control of NATO forces at all levels of the Chain of
  /// Command down to and including individual units. The formatted messages of
  /// APP-11 are taken from the ADatP-03 database published in form of a baseline.
  /// The latest version of the APP-11 catalogue consists of over 400 messages
